# OpenTofu / Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# Ansible
*.retry
.vault_pass*

# Secrets (should be SOPS-encrypted if committed at all)
*.pem
*.key
!*.pub
*.agekey
age-secret.yaml
# Cleartext secret exports kept at repo root before SOPS encryption — never committed
/cloudflared-token.yaml
/ghcr-helm-repo
/ghcr-pull.json

# mise (local, machine-specific shims — mise.toml itself IS tracked)
.mise/

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/

# Env files
.env

# Helm package artifacts — generated on demand, never the source of truth
*.tgz
# ...except vendored subcharts: the tgz is committed and its digest pinned in
# Chart.lock, so CI can lint fully offline (no GHCR pull at job time)
!charts/*/charts/*.tgz
chart_meta.txt